{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01IB:statement", "parent_tag": "01I6", "chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>\nbe an affine scheme.\nThe functors <MATH_0002> and\n<MATH_0003> define quasi-inverse\nequivalences of categories\n<MATH_0004>\nbetween the category of quasi-coherent <MATH_0005>-modules\nand the category of <MATH_0006>-modules.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, \\mathcal{O}_X) = (\\Spec(R), \\mathcal{O}_{\\Spec(R)})$", "MATH_0002": "$M \\mapsto \\widetilde M$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F} \\mapsto \\Gamma(X, \\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\QCoh(\\mathcal{O}_X)\n\\ar@<1ex>[r]\n&\n\\text{Mod}_R\n\\ar@<1ex>[l]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0006": "$R$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-equivalence-quasi-coherent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:3fa16bf5b418c5cb9a134308752a4ff50ac8befd2b9d66b7680142301645dfc1", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:30b029f009d0f9613a153782823d00834cf566f3bd631df49a67506a36d04728", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0c8a7328d8aebf446a5471614cab535f8c320e6bfbc7b998a54b3c4c802c9b55"}
