{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01ID:statement", "parent_tag": "01I6", "chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an affine scheme.\nThe direct sum of an arbitrary collection of quasi-coherent sheaves\non <MATH_0002> is quasi-coherent. The same holds for colimits.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X = \\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0002": "$X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-colimit-quasi-coherent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:86e1202a56f822ac6dc566715f6d9b5867006ea64fffafc964bf04bc21c7a991", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e24c71ff82d0a313e336f0813ca4aece76831b898c6124a3aecf0a9a16f01b00", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c63a181d89ceab00fbc75c5c2b8c96481767b22ad9976264197fea7203a8b157"}
